===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# {{context|manner|lang=en}} in a [[frank]], [[open]] or (too) [[honest]] manner.
#: ''He spoke '''frankly''' about the economy.''
# {{context|speech act|lang=en}} [[in truth|In truth]], [[to tell the truth]].
#: '''''Frankly''', my dear, I don't give a damn.''

